AI ACADEMY SOUTH AFRICA · PITCHATHON

Evidence reconciliation
for food-traceability
investigations

Klarrow helps an operator assemble and challenge fragmented supplier, production and
dispatch records - with source grounding, human decisions and explicit uncertainty.

Prototype demonstration · 18 October 2026 · Run 4 controlled synthetic scenario
THE INVESTIGATION MOMENT

A supplier alert starts a document hunt,

not a clean database query.

                                                                                            RECORDS ARRIVE IN DIFFERENT SHAPES

01 Which batches used the lot?                                                              PDF                                 CSV       XLSX

           Production sheets, batch records and stock ledgers rarely share one identifier.

02 Which customers received them?                                                                LOG                                 EML

           Dispatch notes and invoices sit across warehouses, carriers and spreadsheets.    same lot, different identifiers
                                                                                            kg vs units
03 Where does the evidence stop lining up?                                                  missing pages · near-match codes

           Quantities disagree; records are missing; typos look like real lot codes.

The operator must assemble, challenge and document the evidence trail. Klarrow is designed for that moment - not to decide food safety.

Klarrow · evidence-reconciliation workbench                                                                                                     02
THE WORKBENCH

One workbench: ingest, ground, review, trace, export.

1 Ingest                                     › 2 Extract  › 3 Ground  › 4 Review  › 5 Trace & export

                                                                      SUPPORTED INPUTS

                                                                      Text · CSV/TSV · Excel · EML · logs · text-selectable
                                                                      PDF

                                                                      HONEST BOUNDARY

                                                                      Images and scanned PDFs are retained but not OCR'd.
                                                                      The prototype does not read handwriting or
                                                                      photographs.

                                                                      Klarrow sits beside the system of record. It does not
                                                                      replace the ERP.

