THE AI ROLE

Meta Llama proposes candidate facts.
Deterministic code and people decide.

                                                                                                                                                                     LOCAL META LLAMA 3.2 3B

                                                                                                                                                                     Candidate fact extraction from supported text. No cloud model call
                                                                                                                                                                     in this run.

                                                                                                                                                                     DETERMINISTIC PARSERS

                                                                                                                                                                     Structured rows, lots, quantities and trace-link proposals. Graph
                                                                                                                                                                     traversal is code, not the model.

                                                                                                                                                                     HUMAN REVIEWER

                                                                                                                                                                     Confirms, rejects or edits with a reason. Every decision is written to
                                                                                                                                                                     the audit trail.

15       35           4                                                                                                                                              3                 8

AI rows  parser rows  value-in-quote                                                                                                                                 adjacent context  identifier-only

