THE HUMAN GATE

A relationship is not confirmed just because
a model proposed it.

                                                                                                                          RUN 4 REVIEW OUTCOME

                                                                                                                          • 8 relationship proposals.
                                                                                                                          • 7 confirmed by the operator; 1 rejected.
                                                                                                                          • The rejected link is a false-positive dispatch phrase: "Run 2
                                                                                                                          output: PB-2026-1013-B".
                                                                                                                          • RM-O873 / RM-0873 alias deferred, not silently merged.
                                                                                                                          • Supporting facts reviewed for confirmed links; 36 facts
                                                                                                                          remain unreviewed.

The false positive is a feature of the demo, not a hidden failure: the gate caught it before it entered confirmed scope.  Confirmation records a human decision. It is not
                                                                                                                          independent proof of truth.
